window.INFO_PAGES_TEXT = "## Family, birth and relationships\n\n- [Register a birth](https://alpha.gov.bb/family-birth-relationships/register-a-birth) — Record a newly born child with the Barbados civil registry.\n- [Get a copy of a birth certificate](https://alpha.gov.bb/family-birth-relationships/get-birth-certificate) — Order an official copy of a birth certificate.\n- [Register a death](https://alpha.gov.bb/family-birth-relationships/register-a-death) — Record a death with the civil registry.\n- [Get a copy of a death certificate](https://alpha.gov.bb/family-birth-relationships/get-death-certificate) — Order an official copy of a death certificate.\n- [Register a marriage](https://alpha.gov.bb/family-birth-relationships/register-a-marriage) — Record a marriage with the civil registry.\n- [Get a copy of a marriage certificate](https://alpha.gov.bb/family-birth-relationships/get-marriage-certificate) — Order an official copy of a marriage certificate.\n- [Marriage licences](https://alpha.gov.bb/family-birth-relationships/marriage-licences) — Apply for a licence to get married in Barbados.\n- [Apply for a place at a day nursery](https://alpha.gov.bb/family-birth-relationships/apply-for-a-place-at-a-day-nursery) — Request a nursery place for your child.\n## Work and employment\n\n- [Jobseekers](https://alpha.gov.bb/work-employment/jobseekers) — Find a job, develop skills, or manage employment changes.\n- [Apply to be a Project Protégé mentor](https://alpha.gov.bb/work-employment/apply-to-be-a-project-protege-mentor) — Volunteer as a mentor on the Project Protégé programme.\n- [Apply to the Barbados YouthADVANCE Corps (BYAC)](https://alpha.gov.bb/work-employment/apply-to-the-barbados-youthadvance-corps) — Join the BYAC youth development programme.\n- [Community Sports Training Programme](https://alpha.gov.bb/work-employment/register-for-community-sports-training-programme) — Register for a Youth Development Programme community sports course.\n- [Register for a summer camp](https://alpha.gov.bb/work-employment/register-summer-camp) — Sign a child up for a government summer camp.\n- [Apply to volunteer at a sports camp](https://alpha.gov.bb/work-employment/apply-to-volunteer-at-a-sports-camp) — Offer your time as a sports camp volunteer.\n- [Apply for a position as a temporary teacher](https://alpha.gov.bb/work-employment/apply-for-a-position-as-a-temporary-teacher) — Apply to teach on a short-term basis in a state school.\n- [Apply to the Job Start Plus programme](https://alpha.gov.bb/work-employment/apply-to-jobstart-plus-programme) — Join the Job Start Plus employment scheme.\n## Money and financial support\n\n- [Apply for financial assistance](https://alpha.gov.bb/money-financial-support/apply-financial-assistance) — If you live in Barbados and need financial help you can apply for financial assistance.\n- [EZPay](https://alpha.gov.bb/money-financial-support/ezpay) — Pay government bills and fees online.\n- [Tax online](https://alpha.gov.bb/money-financial-support/tax-online) — File and manage your taxes online.\n- [Get disaster relief assistance](https://alpha.gov.bb/money-financial-support/get-disaster-relief-assistance) — Apply for support if you've been affected by a disaster.\n- [Get a Primary School Textbook Grant](https://alpha.gov.bb/money-financial-support/get-a-primary-school-textbook-grant) — Apply for help with the cost of primary school textbooks.\n## Travel, ID and citizenship\n\n- [Apply for a passport](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/apply-for-a-passport) — Get a Barbados passport for international travel.\n- [Visa information](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/visa-information) — Find out about visas for entering Barbados.\n- [Visitor permit application](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/visitor-permit-application) — Apply for permission to stay in Barbados as a visitor.\n- [Medical requirements](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/medical-requirements) — Check the health documents needed to enter Barbados.\n- [National registration](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/national-registration) — Register for a national ID.\n- [Getting around Barbados](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/getting-around-barbados) — Information on transport around the island.\n- [Local information](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/local-information) — General information for residents and visitors.\n- [Ports of Entry](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/ports-of-entry) — Details of airports and seaports you can use to enter the country.\n- [Get a document notarised](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/get-a-document-notarised) — Have a document officially certified.\n- [Redirect my personal mail](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/post-office-redirection-individual) — Ask the Post Office to forward your personal mail.\n- [Redirect my business mail](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/post-office-redirection-business) — Ask the Post Office to forward mail for your business.\n- [Tell the Post Office someone has died](https://alpha.gov.bb/travel-id-citizenship/post-office-redirection-deceased) — Notify the Post Office that a person has died so their mail can be handled.\n## Business and trade\n\n- [Start a business](https://alpha.gov.bb/business-trade/start-a-business) — Guidance on setting up a new business in Barbados.\n- [Business policies and law](https://alpha.gov.bb/business-trade/business-policies-and-law) — Read the legal framework businesses must operate within.\n- [Financial services for businesses](https://alpha.gov.bb/business-trade/financial-services-for-businesses) — Find banking and finance options for your business.\n- [Government requirements](https://alpha.gov.bb/business-trade/government-requirements) — Understand the compliance obligations for running a business.\n- [Information about business tax](https://alpha.gov.bb/business-trade/information-about-business-tax) — Learn what taxes your business has to pay.\n## Public safety\n\n- [Report a concern about a child](https://alpha.gov.bb/public-safety/report-a-concern-about-a-child) — Report worries about a child's safety or welfare.\n- [Report elderly abuse](https://alpha.gov.bb/public-safety/report-elderly-abuse) — Report suspected abuse or neglect of an older person.\n- [Get support for a victim of domestic abuse](https://alpha.gov.bb/public-safety/get-support-for-a-victim-of-domestic-abuse) — Find help and support for someone affected by domestic abuse.";
